Lets the factory be given the AudioTransport that carries the microphone's sound to the
senders, which the wrapper uses for custom audio sources. From webrtc-sdk/libwebrtc's
patches/custom_audio_source_m150.patch, moved to M156 (CreatePeerConnectionFactory now
has two overloads, and the voice engine makes its AudioState in a helper).

